n## \\$549.99\n\nPreassembled primary sump pump plus battery backup, suitable when replacing an older system.\n\nThe Home Depot\n\n## Types of backup systems\n\n| Type | Main advantage | Limitation |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| Battery-powered backup pump | Protects against outages and primary pump failure | Battery runtime is limited |\n| Water-powered backup | Can run indefinitely with municipal water pressure | Uses city water and requires more plumbing |\n| Battery inverter backup | Can power an existing AC pump | Does not protect against mechanical pump failure |\n| Combination system | Includes primary and backup pumps | Higher initial cost |\n\nConsumer Reports tested 11 backup systems and published its 2026 recommendations. \ue200cite\ue202turn382284search0\ue201\n\n## What to look for\n\nPrioritize pumping capacity at your actual discharge height, battery runtime, an independent float switch, high-water alarms, and battery health monitoring. A battery may last"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/requiredComponents/1","o":"replace","v":"Cite"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/requiredComponents","o":"append","v":["Entity"]},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/624eac0f-78cb-533b-95ff-98c4c916401a","o":"add","v":{"status":"resolved","state":{"items":[{"url":"https://www.consumerreports.org/home-garden/sump-pumps/best-sump-pump-backup-systems-of-the-year-a4309816655/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","ref_id":"turn382284search0","refs":[{"turn_index":382284,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":0}],"source_label":"Consumer Reports","source_name":"Consumer Reports","title":"Best Sump Pump Backup Systems","snippet":null,"pub_timestamp":1767225600.0,"metadata_label":"January 1, 2026"}],"active_index":0,"sources_title":"1 Source"},"safe_urls":["https://www.consumerreports.org/home-garden/sump-pumps/best-sump-pump-backup-systems-of-the-year-a4309816655/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"],"hide_widget_feedback":true,"componentName":"Cite"}},{"p":"